From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:32:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Bound SQLite heap use in threaded platform databases

Charge database allocations by usable size and grow existing allocations by their net increase. Settle a locally refused allocation through the platform transaction so the database retains its confirmed rows and its open SQLite connection.

Refs coworkerd/coworkerd#81

